    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585310/extras/03a392a07b0fc24654e3ac3ef9bfe6cf.poster.avif?t=1747544896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585310/extras/03a392a07b0fc24654e3ac3ef9bfe6cf.webm?t=1747544896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585310/extras/03a392a07b0fc24654e3ac3ef9bfe6cf.mp4?t=1747544896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle! Exciting! A perfect combination of Tower Defense and TPS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons! Now includes explosive weapons like rocket launchers and the Gatling gun \u2013 even more thrilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features both single-player mode and up to 4-player co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four new distinct classes to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five different maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats through off-battle enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape aboard Lao Da's helicopter after surviving enough rounds!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585310/extras/03a392a07b0fc24654e3ac3ef9bfe6cf.poster.avif?t=1747544896\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585310/extras/03a392a07b0fc24654e3ac3ef9bfe6cf.webm?t=1747544896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585310/extras/03a392a07b0fc24654e3ac3ef9bfe6cf.mp4?t=1747544896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle! Exciting! A perfect combination of Tower Defense and TPS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons! Now includes explosive weapons like rocket launchers and the Gatling gun \u2013 even more thrilling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features both single-player mode and up to 4-player co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four new distinct classes to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five different maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats through off-battle enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape aboard Lao Da's helicopter after surviving enough rounds!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "KUNKUN Defender 2 is a hybrid TPS and tower defense game where players must fend off waves of zombies in virus-infected zones, holding their ground until a helicopter arrives for extraction.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
